      "trackName": "Star Duster",
      "description": "***** \"A rare Apple Watch game that's actually worth playing\" - iMore\n***** \"A game you’ll return to\" - GQ Magazine\n***** \"Travel back to the 80s\" - AppAdvice\n\nStar Duster for iPhone and Apple Watch takes handheld games (and you) back to their origins:\n- Two game modes with different challenges, gameplay and high score lists!\n- Let's get physical! Get exercise and a new type of challenge by controlling Star Duster with your head through push ups (iOS)\n- A Beep-boop-ity soundscape that will get stuck on your brain!\n\nStar Duster is a prequel to the mobile arcade mayhem that is Star Jolt. Can it explain why the space junk is lined up so neatly?",
